		(uuid "0b977b36-0dda-4544-8ee6-4aa716ecee77")
	)
	(text "GUC BUTCESI ~2.8 W -> 12V'ta ~230 mA. 10 Ah aku ile ~40 saat.\nSaha modunda ikinci PHY yazilimdan kapatilabilir, 0.25 W kazanc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "11b562a1-61d3-42da-8144-633e45e57f21")
	)
	(text "U9 (+1V8_CLK) ADCLK846'nin VS rayi. Veri sayfasi basligi:\n'1.8 V, 6 LVDS/12 CMOS Output Clock Fanout Buffer'. Saat bolumu\nbastan 3.3 V varsayilmisti — tampon o rayda calismaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2842930e-43a2-4649-9e9d-724c47463337")
	)
	(text "Vout = 0.8 x (1 + R3/R4).  3.3V icin oran 3.125\nL1, Cin ve Cout datasheet Tablo 8'den."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a78b2f2-b56e-4d38-adc2-7c0845473a10")
	)
	(text "1.1V icin oran 0.375.  EN zinciri: U1 PG -> U2 EN,\nguc siralamasi VCC(1.1) once, sonra VCCAUX, sonra VCCIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42aa57ec-0f34-49f1-adad-430c6c88adab")
	)
	(text "+1V8\nFPGA VCCIO\nbanka 6/3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 219 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44033e12-88a0-4247-b65b-b2d14f160eb5")
	)
	(text "DAC AVDD\nFERRIT, LDO DEGIL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5882aa92-0075-4ac9-884c-c6fd4fe6eb64")
	)
	(text "FB6 (+3V3_CLK) VCXO zincirinin beslemesi, FB7 (+3V3_A) DAC AVDD.\nOnce LDO'ydular: giris +3V3, cikis 3.3 V — bir regulator kendi giris\ngerilimini uretemez. Ferrit + 10 uF, 2.5 MHz'te ayni bastirmayi veriyor.\nBesleme gurultusu DOGRUDAN faz gurultusune donusuyor — manset spec burada."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "59c24487-c2cb-4386-af96-fad61455170b")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG sadece VIN_PROT'ta: o ray konnektorden geliyor, gercek guc\ncikisi pini yok. Regulator ciktilarina bayrak konursa ERC cakisma verir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5d2898c4-a4a3-409f-85a1-0d58679da182")
	)
	(text "ANA RAY +3V3 — TPS62130, 3-17V giris, 3A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "620dc4ca-5b6d-4383-8637-3878596b2350")
	)
	(text "FPGA CEKIRDEK +1V1 — TPS62130 #2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 100 0)
		(effects
